window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>**<i>Instant New York Times bestseller</i>**</p> <p>I'm naturally gifted on the field and between the sheets. With flashy cars and enough media attention to put the Royal Family to shame, I’m the definition of Most Eligible Bachelor.</p> <p>Every man wants to be me and every woman wants to tame me.</p> <p>Until Camila.</p> <p>The moment I lay eyes on her, I know I have to have her.</p> <p>She wants to keep me at arm's length.</p> <p>I want her naked in my bed.</p> <p>She thinks our worlds are too different.</p> <p>All I want her to think about is screaming my name.</p> <p>She says I’m bad news.</p> <p>I have three weeks to prove her wrong.</p>"; 
